@startuml UC-68
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-68.md
title UC-68: Order Statistics
footer Feature DASH-02 | Business rules: BR-07, BR-40
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "Admin/DashboardController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "DashboardService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

note over API : Requires role: Admin

U -> MVC : Choose period
MVC -> API : GET /api/admin/dashboard/orders-by-status?from={from}&to={to}
API -> SVC : GetOrdersByStatusAsync(from, to)
SVC -> DB : COUNT(*) of orders WHERE CreatedAt in period\nGROUP BY OrderStatus (BR-40)
DB --> SVC : Aggregated rows
SVC -> SVC : Fill missing periods with zero
SVC --> API : OrderStatusCountDto[]
API --> MVC : 200 OK
MVC --> U : Show chart and table

@enduml
